## The Bypass Alternative

**The Bypass Alternative is the single closest certified-market design to a true tension setting for marquise.** In a bypass setting, the ring shank splits as it approaches the centre and the two halves of the band pass by the stone on opposite sides — one half above the stone, one below. The centre stone sits in the "gap" between them, held by prongs or a kite-set basket. Visually it reads as a stone floating between the two bands. Mechanically it uses safe prong hold, not tension pressure.

<table class="dc-custom-table"><thead><tr><th>Setting Feature</th><th>True Tension</th><th>Bypass Pavé Kite-Set</th><th>What this means</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Visual effect</strong></td><td>Stone floats between band ends</td><td>Stone floats between bypass halves</td><td>Visually similar.</td></tr><tr class="highlight-row"><td><strong>Stone hold method</strong></td><td>Compression pressure</td><td>Prongs on kite-set basket</td><td>Bypass is mechanically safe.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Marquise tip pressure</strong></td><td>High at both tips</td><td>None — prongs on tips</td><td>Bypass eliminates the pressure risk.</td></tr><tr class="highlight-row"><td><strong>Resize-friendly</strong></td><td>No</td><td>Yes (standard resize)</td><td>Bypass behaves like normal setting on resize.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Failure risk</strong></td><td>Single point of failure</td><td>Multiple prong backup</td><td>Bypass is fail-safe.</td></tr><tr class="highlight-row"><td><strong>Price range</strong></td><td>$2,000+ custom</td><td>$1,740 off-the-shelf</td><td>Bypass is cheaper AND safer.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Market availability</strong></td><td>Zero for marquise</td><td>Multiple options in all metals</td><td>Bypass is retailable; tension is not.</td></tr></tbody></table>

**Verdict:** The Bypass Pavé Kite-Set is the honest "tension-adjacent" pick for marquise. The [14k Yellow Gold variant at $1,740](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/bypass-pave-kite-set-diamond-engagement-ring-in-14k-yellow-gold-by-james-allen-item-304940?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational), [White Gold at $1,740](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/bypass-pave-kite-set-diamond-engagement-ring-in-14k-white-gold-by-james-allen-item-304939?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational), and [Rose Gold at $1,740](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/bypass-pave-kite-set-diamond-engagement-ring-in-14k-rose-gold-by-james-allen-item-304941?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) all give the floating-stone look at a safe price.

