## Diamond Pairing Math — 1ct to 2ct Marquise Centre

Tension-adjacent settings pair best with small-to-mid-size centres. Above 2ct the stone's own weight stresses even safe bypass or vine mounts, and traditional prong, halo, or bezel settings become more practical. Pairing math for the common centre carat tiers:

