<table class="dc-custom-table"><thead><tr><th>Setting Family</th><th>Setting Cost</th><th>Marquise-Safe</th><th>Floating-Stone Look</th><th>What this means</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>True tension</strong></td><td>$2,000+ (custom only)</td><td>No</td><td>Yes — but risky</td><td>Avoid. The physics don't work for marquise.</td></tr><tr class="highlight-row"><td><strong>Bypass pavé kite-set</strong></td><td>$1,740</td><td>Yes</td><td>Yes</td><td>Our pick. Floating look + safe prongs.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Diamond vine side-stone</strong></td><td>$5,825–$6,335</td><td>Yes</td><td>Yes (vintage look)</td><td>Premium alternative. 18k/platinum lifetime metal.</td></tr><tr class="highlight-row"><td><strong>Solitaire (V-tip)</strong></td><td>$790–$2,850</td><td>Yes</td><td>No — classic look</td><td>Different aesthetic. See <a href="/marquise-solitaire-engagement-ring">solitaire guide</a>.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Halo</strong></td><td>$1,255–$5,985</td><td>Yes</td><td>No — framed stone</td><td>Different aesthetic. See <a href="/marquise-halo-engagement-ring">halo guide</a>.</td></tr><tr class="highlight-row"><td><strong>Bezel (full)</strong></td><td>$990–$4,625</td><td>Yes (safest)</td><td>No — wrapped stone</td><td>Max protection. See <a href="/marquise-bezel-engagement-ring">bezel guide</a>.</td></tr></tbody></table>

**Verdict:** For the floating-stone aesthetic, bypass pavé kite-set and vine side-stone are the only honest certified-market options. True tension setting on marquise is a mechanical dead-end. All classic setting families (solitaire, halo, bezel) deliver different aesthetics that work mechanically — they just don't give the floating look.

